---
title: "National Electrical Code II"
code: "ELE-132"
category: "electrical-technology"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Provides comprehensive study of the purpose and interpretations of the National Electric Code as well as familiarization and implementation of various charts, code rulings and wiring methods including state and local regulations. Part II of II. Lecture 3 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
